  "notes": "Authored by Cassy (cas-b512) for violet_ps#50; Cloud owns no Violet tool surface. The hub resolves an external_ref through its authenticated Slack installation and returns verified thread identity plus an opaque identity proof that Cloud checks against the team installation binding. It never fetches an arbitrary URL and never trusts a supplied thread_ts, workspace name or team id. Responses are the tool result object.",
